===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|en|enm|biggen}}, {{m|enm|byggen}}, from {{der|en|non|byggja}}, {{m|non|byggva||to build, dwell in, inhabit}}, a secondary form of {{cog|non|búa||to dwell}}, related to {{cog|ang|buan|būan|to dwell}}. Cognate with {{cog|da|bygge}}, {{cog|sv|bygga}}.

